{"4187070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Version Control", "steam_appid": 4187070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Version Control</strong> is an experimental, narrative-driven VR experience where you take the role of a playtester dropped into an unfinished game, guided by a developer who may (or may not) still be in control of his own creation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>genre-shifting environments</strong> that blend physics-driven puzzles, self-aware comedy, a relaxing resort experience, enticing VR combat, corporate training simulations, and creeping psychological horror, all built on a consistent, fully interactive VR foundation. Everything follows the same rules…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>until something breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/a3b14ce871f7d9382c62006607c69a81.avif?t=1785434369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras_big/a3b14ce871f7d9382c62006607c69a81.webp?t=1785434369 width=1560 height=393 /></span><strong>A Charismatic Narrator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are guided by the developer himself. As you test mechanics and explore broken features, he adapts in real time, taking notes, rebuilding, rethinking, and doing everything he can to turn this unfinished project into the most “definitive” VR game ever… with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full VR Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is physics based. Grab, throw, wedge, jam, exploit, or do things in ways the developer didn’t plan for. <br> <br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▯ GO OUT OF BOUNDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u̷n̸u̴s̷e̸d̷ d̷o̵e̴s̶ not mea⍰ u̵n̷w̴█̸n̷t̶e̸d̷</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unfinished spaces, discarded mechanics, and places you were never meant to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to the award-winning <strong>2024 BONEJAM</strong> mod of the same name, <strong>Version Control</strong> returns with a new storyline set in the same universe, expanding on its experimental physics, narrative focus, and self-aware comedic narration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about making a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About mistakes and rewrites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About passion and exhaustion. <br><br><strong>Welcome, Playtester.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Version Control</strong> is an experimental, narrative-driven VR experience where you take the role of a playtester dropped into an unfinished game, guided by a developer who may (or may not) still be in control of his own creation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>genre-shifting environments</strong> that blend physics-driven puzzles, self-aware comedy, a relaxing resort experience, enticing VR combat, corporate training simulations, and creeping psychological horror, all built on a consistent, fully interactive VR foundation. Everything follows the same rules…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>until something breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/a3b14ce871f7d9382c62006607c69a81.avif?t=1785434369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras_big/a3b14ce871f7d9382c62006607c69a81.webp?t=1785434369 width=1560 height=393 /></span><strong>A Charismatic Narrator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are guided by the developer himself. As you test mechanics and explore broken features, he adapts in real time, taking notes, rebuilding, rethinking, and doing everything he can to turn this unfinished project into the most “definitive” VR game ever… with your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/959e5cb81ca0f98f01367715ab6df318.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full VR Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is physics based. Grab, throw, wedge, jam, exploit, or do things in ways the developer didn’t plan for. <br> <br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/62e76ff06cbe2ad4908c59173a709371.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▯ GO OUT OF BOUNDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >u̷n̸u̴s̷e̸d̷ d̷o̵e̴s̶ not mea⍰ u̵n̷w̴█̸n̷t̶e̸d̷</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unfinished spaces, discarded mechanics, and places you were never meant to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.poster.avif?t=1785434369\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.webm?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/extras/f5d1ee2dd46107fb0281a7d2285a0210.mp4?t=1785434369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to the award-winning <strong>2024 BONEJAM</strong> mod of the same name, <strong>Version Control</strong> returns with a new storyline set in the same universe, expanding on its experimental physics, narrative focus, and self-aware comedic narration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about making a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About mistakes and rewrites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About passion and exhaustion. <br><br><strong>Welcome, Playtester.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Version Control is an Experimental Physics Narrative VR Adventure. Test new gimmicks to assist the creation of the most “definitive” VR experience. Each level features a whole new genre to explore in a fully physics-based VR environment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/614c3b8835c064cc7519de6f6c61003eb068b342/header.jpg?t=1785434369", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187070/1ecc9754b2e66f0fa5cf43e5e02666f1f8ee9538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785434369", "caps